<title>HONG KONG: Rhine 1996 year net loss HK$152.87 mln.</title>
<headline>Rhine 1996 year net loss HK$152.87 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   99.0 loss   vs 20.2 gain (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs 2.5 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  97.26 loss  vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    152.87 loss vs 27.09 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     423.99	vs 584.28</p>
<p>    Company name		 Rhine Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Rhine Holdings is a jewellery manufacturer.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$53.61 million on provision for excess stocks, loss of HK$9.05 million on provision for doubtful debts, loss of HK$22.63 million on provision for retail store closure costs and loss of HK$11.99 million on business restructuring costs.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings and final dividend have been adjusted for a three-for-five bonus share issue and four-into-one share consolidation.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs 2.5 H.K. cents (adjusted).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
